  %% PRD-006 Part 3: crobot subscribes, the platform models on its own queue, crobot pulls stored rows.
  SVC[Crobot experiment services<br/>start / change / stop / archive] -->|PUT / DELETE …/subscription<br/>project_id · X-Service-Token| API[Collector sync API<br/>/api/v1/experiments/*]
  API -->|upsert| SUB[(ClickHouse<br/>metric_subscriptions)]
  API -->|enqueue high priority| Q[(Redis<br/>modeler:queue · run state)]

  SCH[Modeler scheduler<br/>every 15 min] -->|new events / stale / stopped| Q
  Q --> W[Modeler workers<br/>computeDailyRows]
  W -->|exposures ⟕ events / event_items<br/>FX previous day| CH[(ClickHouse<br/>events · exposures · event_items<br/>fx_rates_history)]
  W -->|insert run_id rows| MD[(ClickHouse<br/>metric_daily)]
  W -->|last_ready_run_id · quality| Q
  W -.->|summary-ready / query-ready<br/>HMAC webhook| HOOK[Crobot webhook receiver]

  JOB[Crobot SyncMetricSummaryJob<br/>15-min cron + webhook] -->|GET …/daily-summary<br/>?project_id=&since_run_id=| API
  API -->|read last ready run| MD
  JOB -->|replace rows| MS[(Crobot MySQL<br/>metric_summary)]
  HOOK --> JOB

  XQ[Crobot query jobs<br/>extras · breakdowns · sync button] -->|POST / GET …/queries| API
  API -->|cached result 1 h| Q

  STAT[Crobot stats calls] -->|POST /api/v1/stats<br/>summed rows| ST[Collector stats<br/>stateless Monte Carlo]

  V[Vue Analytics V2 UI] -->|reads MySQL only| MS

